      "suggestedVersionCode": "171904",
      "description": "Molly, the hardened Signal fork, with a small signature-protected gateway that lets the\nMolly Wear relay show your chats on a Pixel Watch.\n\n* Install \"Molly Wear relay\" from this repo too, and the watch app from the GitHub release.\n* Signed with this project's own key: it cannot update the official Molly. Make a backup,\n  uninstall Molly, install this one, then restore.\n* Built against Signal's official libsignal while Molly's artifacts are unavailable, so\n  Molly's proxy-only libsignal change is not included yet.\n\nUnofficial build, not affiliated with or endorsed by the Molly project.",
