      "description": "Phone-side helper for Molly4Watch. It talks to the Molly Wear app on your watch over the\nWear Data Layer and reads your chats from Molly through a local, same-key-only channel.\n\n* Nothing is shown on the watch while Molly is locked.\n* Needs the \"Molly (Molly4Watch)\" app from this repo (same signing key).\n* Install the watch app from the GitHub release: https://github.com/TheWindWalkerX/Molly4Watch/releases/latest",
